The major update to Children of Colossus is released: 
1. Add a new "Dark Soul" game mode, one hit to death; 
2. Add 5 more achievements for hardcore challengers; 
3. Change English voice acting; 
4. Support Simplified Chinese; 
5. Add Steam trading cards; 

Just like @LoveAlotBear said: "The graphics are pretty good, and it is a novel concept. Therefore, for $5, why not. It is an interesting experience!"

